su name systemd bridge read from filename input to name map produce be ceremony def
  from filename of from of this fromstate wo systemd to name produce be read do
  su name produce ret
prah

su name systemd bridge write ob name map input to filename produce be ceremony def
  ob name of ob of this become name systemd to filename of to of this be write do
  su name consequence ret
prah

exists su name systemd bridge read be export ya
exists su name systemd bridge write be export ya
